          <li>van Zoonen, W., Morgan-Thomas, A. & Tursunbayeva, A. (2026). <em>Beyond AI disclosure: Claim accountability and responsible research in scholarly publishing.</em> European Management Journal, 44(4), 550–556. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.emj.2026.06.001">doi:10.1016/j.emj.2026.06.001</a></li>
        </ol>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button" href={internal('drafts')}>Back to drafts</a>
          <a class="button secondary" href={internal('publications/authorial-capacity-constraint')}>Working Paper 001 v0.3</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>